@LibraryApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7054

### List books
GET {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Create a book
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin"
}

### Add a member
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Avery Reader",
  "email": "avery@example.com"
}

### Check out a book (replace the IDs with values returned above)
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "memberId": 1
}

### Add a Book Damage fine (amount is fixed at ₹0)
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/fines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fineType": "Book Damage",
  "bookId": 1
}

### Add a Late Submission fine after the loan has been returned late
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/fines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fineType": "Late Submission",
  "bookId": 1,
  "amount": 25.00
}

### Record a fine payment (paymentDate is a calendar date, without a timezone)
POST {{LibraryApi_HostAddress}}/api/fines/1/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentDate": "2026-10-27",
  "paymentMethod": "UPI"
}
